{
  "slug": "py-pit",
  "name": "Py Pit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin for Python development",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `alembic-migrations` (Production-safe Alembic migration workflows for SQLAlchemy 2.x projects), `background-jobs-boundaries` (Guardrails for background work in FastAPI and Python services), `click-cli` (Design, generate, and improve Python CLIs using the Click library), `click-cli-linter` (Audit and improve existing Python Click CLIs by identifying architecture problems, anti-patterns, and CLI UX issues, then proposing…), `code-quality` (Opinionated code health stack for Python repos using Ruff, pre-commit, and Markdown linting), `dockerize-service` (Generate a local-development Docker Compose setup for an existing Python project), `fastapi-errors` (Opinionated error architecture for FastAPI services), `fastapi-init` (Scaffold a complete, production-ready FastAPI project from scratch), and 8 more\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `.mcp.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install py-pit@claude-community` from `robhowley/claude-py-pit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
